          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Campers have a love-hate relationship with the cabin camp-out, a ritual that sends small groups of cabins on a scenic hike around to the far side of the lake for an overnight stay in tents. But when The Hoot starts hearing reports from returning campers sent out on the first couple of overnight trips that something at the campsite isn’t quite right, they know they’re about to find their next big story. ",
